      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLUE MIKI (2) drew on the back row and worked when racing three wide without cover but stuck on to place at Melton last time. Led to win twice in a row prior so can take full advantage of this draw. COLOSIMO (9) is back from a spell of four months and looks to be right up to the mark following a recent trial win. Ended the maiden campaign with a string of top-four results and may have developed with maturity. Look for a good return. MASTER LOUEY (4) eases back in grade on the last attempt and was racing well with a string of placing prior. Proven at this distance and draws well. FLIGHT LOUTENANT (6) has had two months off since putting two minor placings together but has been kept up to the mark with a trial. WINGATE GUY (3) drew wide and worked when fourth here last week. Was racing well prior and is better served by this draw.",
